    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ νυ,</span></b>  nearly <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ δή</span>
			, strengthening the negation by an implied conclusion from the
			foreg., <i>surely not</i>, only in 
				Ep.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.60
			</span></i>, al.; also to strengthen a negative question, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.242
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
